<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Sept industrial production rose 1.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Sept industrial production rose 1.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial production rose 1.0 percent in September against the previous month, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Over the 12 months to September industrial production rose 2.2 percent, according to the bureau's preliminary figures.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm Newsroom, 08-700 1019</p>
</text>
